  "conclusions": [
    "Ten in-scope entries covered. Nine needed a product fix. Entry 651 was supported in both tested modes and now has permanent regressions.",
    "All 15 public hover-plus-diagnostic snapshots agree across native and combined, both versions and all three trials in each project. The injected error appears and clears in all 36 processes.",
    "With combined reuse, continuous edited-document diagnostic medians moved by at most 0.06 ms and continuous hover medians moved by at most 0.05 ms. Structural-edit diagnostics were 7–12 ms slower on these samples. The largest increase in median peak physical footprint was 6.16 MiB on OpenTitan SoC.",
    "For a 1,501-macro include, median initial completion went from 0.279 to 0.706 ms, repeated completion from 0.216 to 0.178 ms, and typed edit plus completion from 1.493 to 1.771 ms."
  ],
